 eport.&nbsp\; </span><span>Your report should demonstrate your understandi
 ng of the event’s main ideas and your ability to reflect on them.&nbsp\;
 </span></p>\n<p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"><span style="font-size: 14pt\;"><st
 rong>Your task is then to write a 300-word report using the structure belo
 w:</strong></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong> Introduction — What did you a
 ttend?</strong></li>\n<li><strong> Summary — What were the main ideas?</
 strong></li>\n<li><strong> Reflection and evaluation —</strong></li>\n<l
 i><strong><strong style="font-size: 1rem\;">Conclusion — What is your ma
 in takeaway?</strong></strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p><span style="font-size: 1re
 m\;">Attached is a very short guide on how to write a report </span></p>\n
