DESCRIPTION:For this self-study activity\, attend one book presentation or 
 one lecture in the Dean’s Conferences series organized by FGSES. Choose 
 an event that interests you\, then write an individual report.  Your repo
 rt should demonstrate your understanding of the event’s main ideas and y
 our ability to reflect on them. \n\nYour task is then to write a 350-word
  report using the structure below:\n\n* Introduction — What did you atte
 nd?\n\n* Summary — What were the main ideas?\n\n* Reflection and evaluat
 ion —\n\n* Conclusion — What is your main takeaway?\n\nAttached is a v
 ery short guide on how to write a report\n\n[self study activity 4 how to 
 write your rpeort B2+.docx] (https://um6p.instructure.com/courses/11216/fi
 les/967148?wrap=1)
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Self-Study Activity N° 4 [LAN108P]
URL;VALUE=URI:https://um6p.instructure.com/calendar?include_contexts=course
 _11216&month=11&year=2026#assignment_36495
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"><span>For this self-
 study activity\, attend </span><strong><span>one book presentation or one 
 lecture in the Dean’s Conferences series organized by FGSES</span></stro
 ng><span>. Choose an event that interests you\, then write an individual r
 eport.&nbsp\; </span><span>Your report should demonstrate your understandi
 ng of the event’s main ideas and your ability to reflect on them.&nbsp\;
 </span></p>\n<p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"><span><strong>Your task is then to 
 write a 350-word report using the structure below:</strong></span></p>\n<o
 l>\n<li><strong>Introduction — What did you attend?</strong></li>\n<li><
 strong>Summary — What were the main ideas?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Re
 flection and evaluation —</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Conclusion — What
  is your main takeaway?</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p><span>Attached is a very 
 short guide on how to write a report</span></p>\n<p><a class="instructure_
 file_link instructure_scribd_file inline_disabled" title="self study activ
 ity 4 how to write your rpeort B2+.docx" href="https://um6p.instructure.co
 m/courses/11216/files/967148?wrap=1" target="_blank" data-canvas-previewab
 le="false" data-api-endpoint="https://um6p.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/
 11216/files/967148" data-api-returntype="File">self study activity 4 how t
 o write your rpeort B2+.docx</a></p>
