DESCRIPTION:you already have the subject: \n\nRead UNSG Guterres final spe
 ech to the UNGA last month.\n\nSelect three points\, themes or arguments f
 rom his speech and say why they matter to you PERSONALLY (no ChatGPT!)\, w
 hy you think they can be achieved\, or sadly why not…\n\nThen read Presi
 dent Trump’s speech to the UNGA and say how his remarks reflect back on 
 your three topics: do they make them impossible\, or can they still work
 …optimistic/pessimistic\, what is your overall assessment with the point
 s made by Guterres but then maybe qualified by Trump?\n\nMaximum 2 sides A
 4 Paper. To be sent to me by 25 October on Canvas
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Mid Terms (INT005ELM-Multilateral Organization and Global Challenge
 s: Threat and Opportunity) [INT005ELM]
URL;VALUE=URI:https://um6p.instructure.com/calendar?include_contexts=course
 _10726&month=10&year=2026#assignment_36373
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>you already have the subject:&nbsp\;</p>\n<
 p>Read UNSG Guterres final speech to the UNGA last month.</p>\n<p>Select t
 hree points\, themes or arguments from his speech and say why they matter 
 to you PERSONALLY (no ChatGPT!)\, why you think they can be achieved\, or 
 sadly why not…</p>\n<p>Then read President Trump’s speech to the UNGA 
 and say how his remarks reflect back on your three topics: do they make th
 em impossible\, or can they still work…optimistic/pessimistic\, what is 
 your overall assessment with the points made by Guterres but then maybe qu
 alified by Trump?<br><br></p>\n<p>Maximum 2 sides A4 Paper. To be sent to 
 me by 25 October on Canvas</p>
END:VEVENT
